l},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-13T06:28:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T16:19:50Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T12:06:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108571","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108571.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108571.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #78595\r\nSupersedes #82826\r\n\r\nThe project settings `locale/test`, `locale/fallback`, `locale/translations`, `locale/translation_remaps` are prefixed with `internationalization/` in 4.x.\r\n\r\nThe tricky part is in `project.godot` where the first segment of the name is saved as the section name in INI format. That is, we need to rename `[locale]` into `[internationalization]` (the brackets are included to avoid false positives). However, section names occupies a whole line, it does not match `\\b\\[locale\\]\\b` because the beginning or end of a line is not considered a word boundary. So this PR adds an extra parameter to `custom_rename()` to skip adding `\\b`s automatically.","closed_by":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu